WEBVTT

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>A new kind of disease has been
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>Following prolonged
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>sufferers develop a pathological
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Experts have named this
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent,
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy,
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:33.500
Episode 8 Budding

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.010
Feels so good...

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.080
More...

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:40.400
Harder!

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:50.520
Hey...

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.490
Your father and little brother are dead.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.950
You haven't been home.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:56.690
What are you doing here?

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:59.420
Have you sold your soul to the devil, Jean?

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.810
Wh-Who are you?

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.000
How did you get in here?

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.680
You're Shian, aren't you?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.000
My father told me about you.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.320
Your father would be heartbroken 
to know you were doing this...

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.200
The daughter of a hero... doing...

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.610
Doing what?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.280
He's dead.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.590
It's up to me how I live my life, isn't it?

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:22.500
What?

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.020
Hey, Jean.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:25.290
Who is this guy?

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:27.600
Do you know each other?

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.020
It hurts...

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.020
My heart...

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:37.520
Quickly, my medicine!

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:39.440
My medicine...

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.100
Bring me my medicine!

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:47.690
Hey!

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:48.490
What are you doing?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.500
Give him his medicine!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.220
Give me that medicine!

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.530
Hey, Jean, what are you doing?

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:28.010
That old man and I just 
finalized our registry.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:29.250
Registry?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.860
He's your husband?

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.350
Why didn't you save him?

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.420
Don't tell me...

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.000
you were after the inheritance?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.360
This is murder!

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:37.500
What are you thinking?!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.460
Bro was an honest man!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.210
How can you be so shameless?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.240
You shut up!

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.500
Shut your mouth! Shut your mouth!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.820
Everyone on the team for your 
last mission died, didn't they?

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.880
Why were you the only one who returned?

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.700
Don't tell me it was just luck!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.760
You're the spy, aren't you?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.020
I don't want to hear any lectures from you!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.020
This is the only way I have 
to repay my debts!

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.280
You say he's a hero?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.860
You've got to be kidding me!

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:10.180
When I couldn't pay my student fees and 
had to drop out of school, what did he do?

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.530
What about when Mom collapsed 
and went to the hospital?

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:14.250
What did he do for her?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.160
Hero my ass!

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.250
That bastard abandoned his family...

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.240
Ever since I was a kid, 
I hardly ever even saw him.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.860
He never did a damn thing for me.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.500
How's he my father, exactly?

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:25.240
Police officers don't make much money,

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.630
but our family was under constant threat.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.010
We had to move over and over again.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.380
He doesn't even know how old I am!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.380
You call him a hero?

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.960
When I was teased and bullied at school,

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:35.500
what did he do to help me?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.370
That "big hero" of yours...

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.970
You don't you even know the 
life he put his family through!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:44.280
What's a police officer really good for, huh?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.610
You got a problem?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.290
I stood by that old pervert,

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.190
but I won't get any inheritance.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.090
It's all going to his ex-wife and child.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.690
All I got was his stock in a ruined school.

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:07.370
Dying of a heart attack serves him right.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:09.300
M-More...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.010
Please...

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.170
Torment me more, please.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.520
You...

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.160
It's all my fault.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.860
Because I got scared.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.850
Even though it was a life-or-death situation,

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.200
I only thought about myself.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.520
I let Bro die, yet I lived...

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.770
I was so scared...

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.500
I didn't want to die.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.410
Ever since then... I haven't slept.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.250
When I close my eyes, 
I just see Bro's dead face.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.010
I can't take it anymore.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:43.820
But when you hit me with the whip,
 my heart feels lighter.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:46.900
It takes away a little of my guilt.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.170
Please, torment me more!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.890
Please!

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.210
If you want to atone,

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:02.520
you can repent with your life.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.880
Next month, come with me to that school.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.530
You're going to give the 
students proper guidance.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.490
Be careful!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.290
Watch yourself.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.500
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.800
Head Instructor, good work.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.500
Have you nearly finished moving the packages?

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.010
You're far too easy on the students.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.500
Look at Shin and Hibiki.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:33.010
Those two are throwing the 
whole school into chaos.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.570
You need to be careful, too.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.970
Don't forget your position.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.220
You made it through safely this time,

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:42.030
but if something really does happen,

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.790
you'll be forced to take responsibility.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.250
<i>I...</i>

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.300
<i>Am I atoning?</i>

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.010
Oh, it hurts too much! I can't keep this up!

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.250
Come on, look at my feet!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:17.480
They're covered in blisters!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:20.000
It was only five kilometers of running.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.010
Toughen up.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:22.400
It's not just that!

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.430
We have to clean the classrooms 
and bathrooms, right?

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.140
I'll use my hands and feet for those, too...

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:29.080
I'm just so exhausted!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:32.530
Cleaning is better than having naked 
pictures taken of you, isn't it?

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:36.020
And Shin took away my precious treasure.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:38.240
I really am all alone.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.200
I'll just have to work 
with my little sister Hoku

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.420
and wait until we can get out of here!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.260
Hey! Stop it!

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:47.000
Don't drag me into this!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.780
At least you have each other.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.550
But I...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.890
Let's not cause any more trouble,

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.510
and just get out of here quickly.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.350
Shiori.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.220
How did you wind up in here, exactly?

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.970
Shouldn't you be with your 
hospitalized little brother?

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:07.930
You look like the honor student type,

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:10.030
so I doubt you really have
 Internet addiction.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.740
Hey, Hoku, stop talking.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.520
If you want to talk to your little brother,

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.290
I can steal you a cell phone.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.660
But we can only connect to the local network.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.660
We need to get your device back.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.880
And once I get it back, 
I can settle things with Shin!

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.500
Local network?

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.990
What do you mean?

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.660
Hey, you.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:37.660
Time's up.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.050
You can come out.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.500
You hear me?

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.990
Quit stalling and come out!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.930
What, did you go crazy 
after two weeks in there?

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:52.970
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:54.400
I'm just fine.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.980
I feel wonderful, in fact.

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:02.490
Wh-What the hell...

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:05.350
Stop talking and go.

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:07.000
I need to clean things up here.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:19.220
Wh-What is...

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.740
Stop! You bitch!

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:45.420
Why do I have to be so unlucky?!

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:48.420
There are two networks?

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.700
For now, we have to be subtle.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.140
I'm short, so they won't notice me as easily.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.610
So leave this to me.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.630
I'm gonna go investigate!

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.580
No! You can't go alone!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.000
You don't get it.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.900
Akane just doesn't want to clean.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:08.310
I just came out for some air! 
Why are you chasing me?

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.520
My feet hurt! I'm gonna die!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.530
Catch her!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.010
We can get a reward!

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.160
Oh, it hurts!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.490
You can't get away now.

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:30.000
Hey, you...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.120
Aren't you Moku, the kid who 
sneaked out by digging a tunnel?

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.570
Haven't seen you in a while.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.770
I thought you'd run away again.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:37.790
That's perfect, though.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:39.720
We'll finish you both off together.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.430
What, you think trash like you can beat me?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.270
Dream on.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:45.210
You, say something.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:49.100
Me? Say what?

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.040
Start resisting already!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.510
You just want to let them pound you?

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.520
Resisting won't work.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.400
Hey, are you...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.560
In this place,

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:02.530
resisting won't change anything.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.990
What's with you?

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.410
You realize resistance is futile, then?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.000
Get them, guys!

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:12.990
Stop it.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.390
<i>H-Hibiki?</i>

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.010
Get lost.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.020
<i>Wh-What happened?</i>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.520
<i>He's like a totally different person.</i>

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.320
Is that Hibiki?

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:39.990
I remember now.

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:43.020
You're the loser that Yoh-san beat up.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.490
What are you talking about?

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.630
Trying to be a hero again?

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.000
You piece of trash.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.000
You just got out of solitary, right?

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.140
Did being locked up make you crazy?

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.500
Say something!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.970
I'm class leader. When you talk 
to me, you'd better kneel!

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.130
Got it?

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.540
You loser.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.170
Kneel this instant!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.250
Ow, ow...

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.530
Let go of my hand!

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.370
Damn it! Let go of my finger!

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:13.930
Let go!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.400
S-Stop it!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.280
What are you looking at?

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.610
Get him!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.270
Right!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.280
<i>I'm not stronger than you guys.</i>

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:23.780
<i>But...</i>

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:27.690
<i>Human joints are equally brittle on anyone.</i>

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:29.520
Ouch!

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:32.530
Mei, you okay?

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.200
I didn't think he'd go so far...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.500
Damn it... I'll kill you!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.280
<i>Here they come.</i>

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:44.000
<i>Keep your eyes open... 
and watch their movements carefully.</i>

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.510
<i>My body's still locking up.</i>

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:49.640
<i>One more time!</i>

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.010
Damn it... Surround him!

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.590
<i>I can't let them surround me.</i>

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.360
Bastard... I got you now!

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.490
You still want to fight?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.520
Don't be scared.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.500
Overwhelm him.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.010
He's just bluffing.

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:22.740
Got you!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:24.010
Now we'll pound you!

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:35.090
What's with this guy?

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.570
Damn... he fights dirty.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.000
Aiming at our joints and weak points...

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.210
That's low!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.020
Still want more?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.060
<i>He's crazy today.</i>

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:50.480
<i>We can't let him beat us.</i>

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:51.440
Let's go.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.160
We can finish him off some other time.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.520
Right...

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:07.700
Hey, you saved me, right?

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.200
I'll see to your injuries.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.370
Come along.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.600
That guy is really strong.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.360
There's nowhere else to go, 
so this warehouse will do.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.860
There are bandages here, too.

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.400
This place is...

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:44.880
Huh?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.720
Darling, you saved me!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.030
Um, thanks!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.040
Thank you so much!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:56.040
I actually wanted to work with you...

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:56.840
Lay one on me! You've gotten even hotter!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:58.100
I get it!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.430
So you saved me because 
you want to be my knight?

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:05.100
I won't just work with you, I'll do it with you!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.860
Wait! Calm down!

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:08.620
Akane!

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.740
We heard Mei's gang were 
chasing you around, and...

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:14.420
Are you okay?

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.600
I'm fine.

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.900
You came during the best part.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.360
Hibiki...

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.830
Look at my darling!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.380
What are you doing here?

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.010
Shiori.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.380
<i>I...</i>

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.380
<i>I won't run away again.</i>

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:37.840
<i>I'm going to keep walking down this road.</i>

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:45.080
Instructor Ryo, what do you need?

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.310
Nothing in particular.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:51.040
I was just hoping for a little sting
 from the queen's whip.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:54.410
You look so beautiful when you're angry.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.550
But why do you always choose 
an old man to take it out on?

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:02.830
I know familiarity is a good thing, 
but Shian is hopelessly boring.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.310
He's such a sourpuss, too.

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:10.980
I could teach you a bit 
about the vigor of youth.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.010
Is that so?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:17.690
Perhaps I'll test that, then.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.850
One, two, three, four!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:23.300
All of you, halt!

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.420
One, two!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.850
Okay, twenty minutes' rest!

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.960
Head Instructor Shian.

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:35.570
Huh?

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.860
Is that...

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.860
He's out of solitary, huh?

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.500
<i>He's showing off again. What's he plotting?</i>

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:45.360
What?

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:49.380
I wish to show my repentance 
before the whole class.

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:53.410
Fine.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.410
Thank you.

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:59.550
While I was in solitary, I reflected on my sin.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:02.280
I started fights with the other classes

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:04.900
and caused a lot of trouble 
for the class four guys.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.400
I won't do it again.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:09.860
I have repented, but it's not enough.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.460
I want to take your teachings to heart,

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:15.140
and think of my classmates 
as my brothers from now on.

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.870
I'd only just gotten here 
so I didn't know much,

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.860
but please give me one more chance.

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:25.370
How'd he say all that embarrassing 
shit with a straight face?

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.360
Hibiki.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:28.680
Well said.

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:30.880
You really are repentant. I'm impressed.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.210
Please keep up your practice 
with this in mind.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.900
A-Are you kidding?

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:36.890
The head instructor is 
totally falling for it.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:39.530
If you can recognize what we're doing here,

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:43.690
you'll find every day in this place 
positive and fulfilling.

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:44.860
I believe in you.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.740
Thank you!

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.360
You're kidding!

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:50.210
It's an obvious sham!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.500
Oh, please!

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:55.800
One, two, three, four!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:59.080
One, two, three, four!

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:01.300
What's a girl's class doing here?

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.350
Think they want to hang out?

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.640
All of you, halt!

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:05.560
At ease!

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:08.850
Instructor, we of class eighteen

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.290
wish to extend a hand of 
friendship to the new students.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.320
Instructor Cho, what is all this?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.610
Head Instructor,

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:20.880
our class has been doing training 
in kung-fu and self-defense.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:24.540
It seems they're not getting 
enough out of the other girls,

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.340
so they want to try it with the boys.

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:28.370
But the ones who have been 
here a while are too strong,

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:29.960
so they could get hurt.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.360
We thought the new students, 
who have only just begun training,

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:33.480
might make good opponents.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.500
What do you think, Head Instructor?

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:39.360
Do you have the courage to tangle with us?

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.780
You afraid of losing to girls?

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.680
What a bunch of cowards.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.460
How can they call themselves men?

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:46.680
Bring it on!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.860
But don't blame us if we make you cry!

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:53.490
Leader Mei and Kohei, Gen, and Jan, step forward!

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:56.690
Hold back, guys.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.690
Don't want to hurt the girls.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.510
In that case...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.180
Ton, Fo, Fuu. Go!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:10.350
<i>They look a lot like men...</i>

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:13.280
Okay, no hitting anyone on the ground.

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:14.350
Begin!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:20.360
Women are still women. 
They can't beat men.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:23.860
Straight punch!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.370
Dead tree chop!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.820
Hook barrage!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.370
Shoulder throw!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.890
Low snap kick!

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:33.560
H-Hey, wait... I'm not ready to...

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.630
Arm lock!

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:36.370
Elbow drop!

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.260
<i>They set us up!</i>

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:40.380
<i>These girls are animals!</i>

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.090
Excuse me, leader...

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.390
It's your turn.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.180
Don't worry.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.350
I'll go easy on you.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.730
That's our Hoku! So cool!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.330
The class four boys are such garbage!

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.420
They didn't even last a minute!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.720
Are you going to let this stand?

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:07.030
Useless fools.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.860
You'll all go without dinner.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.270
What a humiliation for you.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:14.370
Despite the way you throw 
your weight around...

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:15.870
Instructor.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.370
Let me try.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.380
Okay, go on!

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.880
<i>Will Hibiki really be okay?</i>

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:30.850
You want to work together?

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:35.100
If you try to do anything cowardly, 
I'll end you right here.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.800
I wouldn't do anything that transparent.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:40.820
You don't have to hold back.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.090
You don't need to take a fall.

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:44.860
I might not win.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:47.860
But I won't lose.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:50.030
Why don't we make a test out of this?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.660
If I beat you on my own merits,

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.270
will you think about working with me?

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:28.460
Just watch.

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:32.470
Anyone who defies me or mocks me now

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.770
will be forced to repent.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Episode 9
Evil Descending

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.760
You'll see, Shin.

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:39.730
It's your turn now.
